{"hymn":"S530","parent":"E656","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"\"Consideradlo a Él\", modelo fiel","subtitle":"Aliento—Para considerar a Cristo","syl":{"n1":["\"Con","i"],"n2":["si","m"],"n3":["de","m"],"n4":["rad","m"],"n5":["lo‿a","t"],"n6":"Él\",","n7":["mo","i"],"n8":["de","m"],"n9":["lo","t"],"n10":"fiel;","n11":["Cris","i"],"n12":["to","t"],"n13":["te‿a","i"],"n14":["sió,","t"],"n15":["de","i"],"n16":["bes","t"],"n17":["re","i"],"n18":["co","m"],"n19":["no","m"],"n20":["cer,","t"],"n21":["Pa","i"],"n22":["ra","t"],"n23":"que","n24":["ten","i"],"n25":["gas","t"],"n26":"Su","n27":["vi","i"],"n28":["da‿y","t"],"n29":["po","i"],"n30":["der,","t"],"n31":["Pa","i"],"n32":["ra","t"],"n33":"que","n34":["brie","i"],"n35":["lle‿en","t"],"n36":"ti","n37":["la‿i","i"],"n38":["ma","m"],"n40":["gen","t"],"n41":"de‿Él."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["\"Consideradlo‿a Él\", y buscarás","Siempre en el último lugar estar,","Contento de pasar sin fama aquí","Para que obtenga el Padre gloria así."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡No retrocedas, oh hijo de Dios!","Con Cristo ve a la muerte sin temor;","Luego el poder de la vida inmortal","El ego y el pecado anulará."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["\"Consideradlo‿a Él\", y has de ser","Más puro, abnegado y más fiel;","Dios forjará el modelo en tu interior;","Ve siempre el ejemplo del Señor."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["\"Consideradlo‿a Él\", y al correr","Alza tus ojos, ponlos sólo en Él;","Él te transformará y alumbrará;","Su imagen viva así reflejarás."]}]}